@rBeneath the Black Briars@n~
Arching briars make a low tunnel over the trail, hiding it from anyone passing
through the wider forest. Hoofprints and bootmarks multiply here, and ashes
from a recently stamped-out watchfire stain the ground. The concealed path
continues north and west.
