@RThe Blackbriar Camp@n~
The hidden trail ends in a cramped camp screened by thorn and timber. Bedrolls,
saddles, stolen packs, and a tether line reveal the riders' use of the clearing,
while discarded merchant seals and cut purse strings show how they earn their
living. The only clear escape lies back to the east.
